          "snippet": {
            "line": 83,
            "text": "theorem jet_bound_at_closure {f : E → F} {U : Set E} {x : E} {B : ℝ}\n    (hf : ContDiffAt ℝ ∞ f x) (hx : x ∈ closure U) (j : ℕ)\n    (hb : ∀ y ∈ U, ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ j f y‖ ≤ B) :\n    ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ j f x‖ ≤ B"
